"Thank you very much."

00:01:54.940 --> 00:01:57.710
"What a kind person you are, Yumi-sama."

00:01:58.110 --> 00:02:00.510
Did you think I would say that?

00:02:02.250 --> 00:02:05.340
I was unable to get Toko-chan
to accept my rosary.

00:02:05.950 --> 00:02:08.860
I confided this fact to my dear sister.

00:02:11.190 --> 00:02:14.990
Being turned down once is nothing.

00:02:19.200 --> 00:02:20.430
Hold your head high.

00:02:21.070 --> 00:02:21.800
