00:02:23.910 --> 00:02:24.700
But...

00:02:25.870 --> 00:02:27.360
...it does hurt, doesn't it?

00:02:28.580 --> 00:02:29.270
Yes.

00:02:32.610 --> 00:02:33.380
Um...

00:02:34.720 --> 00:02:37.480
Would it be all right if I still cried a bit?

00:02:53.070 --> 00:02:57.940
On the Other Side of the Clouded Glass

00:03:14.860 --> 00:03:15.820
Here you are.

00:03:21.030 --> 00:03:23.190
I am sorry for causing everyone concern.

00:03:25.130 --> 00:03:27.120
It's nothing of great importance.

00:03:27.400 --> 00:03:30.700
